## 🔮 UTL Symbol Expansions Needed

### Missing Context Symbols
- `🤷‍♂️` - Missing assumed spousal/social context
- `⏰📍` - Temporal-spatial context marker
- `🧩` - Partial context available
- `🔮` - Context inference required

### Programming Concepts
- `🔧` - Function/tool
- `📦` - Data structure
- `🔄` - Loop/recursion
- `❓` - Conditional
- `❗↗️` - Error propagation
- `🔀⚖️` - Ternary selection

