## 💭 Philosophy

"Context is Everything" - but context includes:
- Temporal (when said vs when happened)
- Spatial (where were you when you heard)
- Emotional (how important to remember)
- Social (shared vs private knowledge)
- Linguistic (which language/dialect/slang)

All must be captured in UTL or meaning is lost!

